      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A case of anomalous superficialis muscle belly in the palm is presented. Nineteen such cases have been reported until now. Our case differs in that the anomalous muscle originated from the flexor digitorum superficialis tendon to the index finger by way of an accessory tendon."},
